ashi on Gittin 12b:13:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Gittin_12b.13.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 518:4","target":{"entry":518,"paragraph":4},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"raw":"יהודה בן פתירוש שם ג' פעמים ט\"ס הוא וצ\"ל יהודה בן פ\"ר","reason":"The checked text retains Petirosh all three times. The correction remains attributed to Heilprin.","evidence":[{"reference":"Tosefta Oholot 4:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosefta_Oholot_4.7"},"witness":"Tosefta Ohalot - Machon Mamre"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The Bavli names Yehoshua ben Peter Rosh and Eliezer, the checked Tosefta Nazir names Yehudah ben Beteira and Elazar, and the checked Tosefta Oholot has Yehudah ben Petirosh three times. Preserve the received English quotations and record the proposed corrections separately.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Nazir 56b:9:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Nazir_56b.9.3"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Tosafot on Nazir 56b:9:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosafot_on_Nazir_56b.9.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Nazir 56b:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nazir_56b.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Nazir 56b:10:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Nazir_56b.10.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Nazir 56b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nazir_56b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Tosefta Nazir 5:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosefta_Nazir_5.3"},"witness":"Tosefta Nazir - Machon Mamre"},{"reference":"Mishnah Nazir 7:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Nazir_7.4"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 518:4","target":{"entry":518,"paragraph":4},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Rashi on Gittin 12b:13